            <ArticleTitle>Epidural analgesia: educating patients and nurses.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Epidural analgesia is used increasingly in operating theatres, delivery suites and intensive care units to manage post-operative pain. This article examines the importance of education in implementing a new procedure and explores the role of the anaesthetic nurse specialist.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
